  nameEn: Nikhil
  nameColor: {r: 0.37, g: 0.88, b: 0.82, a: 1}
  key: Aap log kyun in cheezon pe bharosa karte ho? Koi kisi ka roop nahi hota...
    koi Bhagwan, Ishwar kuch nahi hota.
  en: Why do you believe in these things? Nobody comes in anyone's form... there's
    no God, nothing.
